西界。宋白曰：史记，齐威王伐晋至博陵。徐广曰：东郡之博平，汉为县。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c08f866-db0e-11ef-9ed5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","place_note":"山東茌平西北","resolved_place_entity_id":812,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c08f875-db0e-11ef-bab8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、东昌府（卷三十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"徐广曰：今东郡之博平是也。亦谓之博关。《战国策》：苏秦曰...","context_before":"○博平故城[县西北三十里。即齐博陵邑也。","source_end_index":42,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ddce6e46-ae65-5f5a-a830-ac715d295544","source_start_index":20,"source_text":"《史记·齐世家》：威王六年，魏伐齐，至博陵。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/四、东昌府（卷三十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"魏伐齊，至博陵。","content_fanyi":"魏国进攻齐国，军队抵达博陵。","content_jianti_auto":"魏伐齐，至博陵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":94,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 烈王 / 三年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c08f865-db0e-11ef-a766-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-373},"tongjian_id":"8c08f865-db0e-11ef-a766-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"博陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：布德執義曰穆；中情見貌曰穆。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谥法：布德执义曰穆；中情见貌曰穆。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"96c67866-db0e-11ef-842b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"樂成縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"乐成县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96c67869-db0e-11ef-8c9b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河間國","place_name_jianti_auto":"河间国","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"96c6786a-db0e-11ef-b249-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"樂成縣，屬河間國。","note_content_jianti_auto":"乐成县，属河间国。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"96c67868-db0e-11ef-a05e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"沈約","people_name_jianti_auto":"沈约","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96c6786c-db0e-11ef-a60a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝崇皇","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝崇皇","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"96c6786d-db0e-11ef-ab3b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"沈約曰：諡法所不載者，如孝崇皇之類是也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"沈约曰：谥法所不载者，如孝崇皇之类是也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"96c6786b-db0e-11ef-ba2b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96c67870-db0e-11ef-9909-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"96c67871-db0e-11ef-870d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蠡吾縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"蠡吾县","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"96c67872-db0e-11ef-9066-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"瀛州","place_name_jianti_auto":"瀛州","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"96c67873-db0e-11ef-8a3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"博野縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"博野县","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"96c67874-db0e-11ef-b641-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：博陵，本蠡吾縣之地也；陵在今瀛州博野縣西。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：博陵，本蠡吾县之地也；陵在今瀛州博野县西。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"96c6786f-db0e-11ef-8008-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","resolved_place_entity_id":813,"start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"96c73c7d-db0e-11ef-a7ad-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、保定府（卷十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...[县东二里。汉县。后汉属中山，安帝封河间王开子翼为侯邑。","source_end_index":72,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"be1c233a-ccc8-541e-8b0c-6372215cc5a0","source_start_index":32,"source_text":"其子志入继大统，是为桓帝，追尊蠡吾侯为孝崇皇，陵曰博陵，因析置博陵县，而蠡吾如故"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/二、保定府（卷十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"8九月，戊戌，追尊河間孝王爲孝穆皇，夫人趙氏曰孝穆后，廟曰清廟，陵曰樂成陵；蠡吾先侯曰孝崇皇，廟曰烈廟，陵曰博陵；皆置令、丞，使司徒持節奉策書璽綬，祠以太牢。","content_fanyi":"九月戊戌日，桓帝刘志追尊祖父河间孝王刘开为孝穆皇，尊祖母赵氏为孝穆后，庙称为清庙，陵称为乐成陵；追尊父亲蠡吾先侯刘翼为孝崇皇，庙称为烈庙，陵称为博陵；都为它们设置令、丞，并派司徒持节捧策书、玺绶，用太牢礼祭祀。","content_jianti_auto":"8九月，戊戌，追尊河间孝王为孝穆皇，夫人赵氏曰孝穆后，庙曰清庙，陵曰乐成陵；蠡吾先侯曰孝崇皇，庙曰烈庙，陵曰博陵；皆置令、丞，使司徒持节奉策书玺绶，祠以太牢。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4477,"number":8,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第五十三 (漢紀四十五) / 孝質皇帝 / 本初元年 / 第 9 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"96c67865-db0e-11ef-9c97-a0d3651f611f","year_int":146},"tongjian_id":"96c67865-db0e-11ef-9c97-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"博陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"恭懷皇后","people_name_jianti_auto":"恭怀皇后","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96db0e07-db0e-11ef-8a97-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"和帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"和帝","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"96db0e08-db0e-11ef-a0ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"梁氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"梁氏","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"96db0e09-db0e-11ef-bfc9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"恭懷皇后，和帝母梁氏。斂，力贍翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"恭怀皇后，和帝母梁氏。敛，力赡翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"96db0e06-db0e-11ef-85a3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","resolved_place_entity_id":813,"start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"96db0e0f-db0e-11ef-b7de-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3夏，四月，甲辰，孝崇皇后匽氏崩；以帝弟平原王石爲喪主，斂送制度比恭懷皇后。五月，辛卯，葬于博陵。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月甲辰日，桓帝的母亲孝崇皇后匽氏去世；由桓帝的弟弟平原王刘石担任丧主，装殓和送葬的制度比照和帝的母亲恭怀皇后。五月十二日辛卯，葬于博陵。","content_jianti_auto":"3夏，四月，甲辰，孝崇皇后匽氏崩；以帝弟平原王石为丧主，敛送制度比恭怀皇后。五月，辛卯，葬于博陵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4542,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第五十三 (漢紀四十五) / 孝桓皇帝上之上 / 二年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"96db0e05-db0e-11ef-a669-a0d3651f611f","year_int":152},"tongjian_id":"96db0e05-db0e-11ef-a669-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"博陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"97b2b094-db0e-11ef-9ae0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『張：「文」作「丈」。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『张：「文」作「丈」。』","note_type":"『張：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"97b2b093-db0e-11ef-bf99-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"97b2b092-db0e-11ef-b02e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"飛燕","people_name_jianti_auto":"飞燕","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"97b2b096-db0e-11ef-aa54-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"于氐根","people_name_jianti_auto":"于氐根","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"97b2b097-db0e-11ef-a298-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"97b2b098-db0e-11ef-a564-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杜預","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜预","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"97b2b099-db0e-11ef-adbd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張白騎","people_name_jianti_auto":"张白骑","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"97b2b09a-db0e-11ef-bcea-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"雷公","people_name_jianti_auto":"雷公","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"97b2b09b-db0e-11ef-8dd8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"大目","people_name_jianti_auto":"大目","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"97b2b09c-db0e-11ef-bc89-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"朱儁傳曰：輕便者言飛燕。于氐根，賢註曰：左傳曰：于思于思。杜預云：于思，多須之貌。騎白馬者爲張白騎。大聲者稱雷公。大眼者爲大目。「左髭文八」作「左髭丈八」。校，戶敎翻。騎，奇寄翻。眭，息隨翻。蝤，才由翻。勝，音升。","note_content_jianti_auto":"朱俊传曰：轻便者言飞燕。于氐根，贤注曰：左传曰：于思于思。杜预云：于思，多须之貌。骑白马者为张白骑。大声者称雷公。大眼者为大目。「左髭文八」作「左髭丈八」。校，户教翻。骑，奇寄翻。眭，息随翻。蝤，才由翻。胜，音升。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"97b2b095-db0e-11ef-b6f9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"97b2b091-db0e-11ef-8cbc-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"suī","source_anchor_text":"大目白繞眭固苦蝤之","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":83,"text":"眭","tongjian_id":"ba1e4f52-d0d4-5a8f-9a31-09ec46ae2e8a"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","resolved_place_entity_id":814,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"97b2b0a9-db0e-11ef-a918-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、怀庆府（卷四十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宇文泰以权景宣守张白坞，此又白骑所筑于崤渑间者，非此坞也...","context_before":"...水会之。坞据二溪之会，北带深隍，三面阻险，惟西版筑而已。","source_end_index":68,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"96d854f2-7242-5865-8db1-031ee6624a61","source_start_index":51,"source_text":"东汉末，贼将张白骑据此筑坞，因名。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/三、怀庆府（卷四十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"4自張角之亂，所在盜賊並起，博陵張牛角、常山褚飛燕及黃龍、左校、于氐根、張白騎、劉石、左髭文八、平漢大計、司隸緣城、雷公、浮雲、白雀、楊鳳、于毒、五鹿、李大目、白繞、眭固、苦蝤之徒，不可勝數，大者二三萬，小者六七千人。","content_fanyi":"自从张角之乱爆发后，各地盗贼一同起事，博陵人张牛角、常山人褚飞燕以及黄龙、左校、于氐根、张白骑、刘石、左髭丈八、平汉大计、司隶缘城、雷公、浮云、白雀、杨凤、于毒、五鹿、李大目、白绕、眭固、苦蝤这些人，多得数不过来，势力大的有两三万人，小的有六七千人。","content_jianti_auto":"4自张角之乱，所在盗贼并起，博陵张牛角、常山褚飞燕及黄龙、左校、于氐根、张白骑、刘石、左髭文八、平汉大计、司隶缘城、雷公、浮云、白雀、杨凤、于毒、五鹿、李大目、白绕、眭固、苦蝤之徒，不可胜数，大者二三万，小者六七千人。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":5036,"number":4,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第五十八 (漢紀五十) / 孝靈皇帝中 / 二年 / 第 6 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"97b2b091-db0e-11ef-8cbc-a0d3651f611f","year_int":185},"tongjian_id":"97b2b091-db0e-11ef-8cbc-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"博陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"景獻皇后","people_name_jianti_auto":"景献皇后","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48bf-db0e-11ef-a93a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景獻后","people_name_jianti_auto":"景献后","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48c0-db0e-11ef-b120-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：玄傳曰：「五年，遷太僕，轉司隸，景獻皇后崩，坐爭位罵尚書免，尋卒。」按景獻后崩在四年，玄傳誤也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：玄传曰：「五年，迁太仆，转司隶，景献皇后崩，坐争位骂尚书免，寻卒。」按景献后崩在四年，玄传误也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48be-db0e-11ef-9089-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"任昉","people_name_jianti_auto":"任昉","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48c5-db0e-11ef-8c5e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"呂向","people_name_jianti_auto":"吕向","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48c6-db0e-11ef-b96b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"文選：任昉彈曹景宗曰：謹奉白簡以聞。呂向註云：簡，略狀也。晉志曰：古者執笏，有事則書之，故常簪筆；今之白筆，是其遺意。三臺、五省二品文官簪之。帶，革帶也，古之鞶帶。劾，戶槪翻，又戶得翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"文选：任昉弹曹景宗曰：谨奉白简以闻。吕向注云：简，略状也。晋志曰：古者执笏，有事则书之，故常簪笔；今之白笔，是其遗意。三台、五省二品文官簪之。带，革带也，古之鞶带。劾，户槪翻，又户得翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48c4-db0e-11ef-a06d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"周官師氏，凡國之貴游子弟學焉。註云：貴游子弟，王公之子弟，游無官司者。懾，之涉翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"周官师氏，凡国之贵游子弟学焉。注云：贵游子弟，王公之子弟，游无官司者。慑，之涉翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48cb-db0e-11ef-a1c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"安帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"安帝","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48cf-db0e-11ef-8d7f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48d0-db0e-11ef-aa1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安平","place_name_jianti_auto":"安平","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48d1-db0e-11ef-a53b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"博陵國","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵国","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48d2-db0e-11ef-ba27-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢安帝分安平，置博陵國。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉安帝分安平，置博陵国。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48ce-db0e-11ef-a819-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","resolved_place_entity_id":814,"start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48d8-db0e-11ef-a51f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"14前司隸校尉傅玄卒。玄性峻急，每有奏劾，或值日暮，捧白簡，整簪帶，竦踊不寐，坐而待旦；由是貴游震懾，臺閣生風。玄與尚書左丞博陵崔洪善，洪亦清厲骨鯁，好面折人過，而退無後言，人以是重之。","content_fanyi":"晋朝前任司隶校尉傅玄去世。傅玄性情严厉急躁，每当上奏弹劾时，有时正赶上黄昏，就手捧白简，把上朝用的簪笔和衣带整理整齐，心绪不宁得无法入睡，坐着等待天亮；因此王公贵族都感到震动恐惧，朝廷台阁也因此增添了整肃之气。傅玄与尚书左丞、博陵人崔洪交好，崔洪也是清廉严厉、刚正耿直的人，喜欢当面指责别人的过错，但退下后从不在背后议论，人们因此敬重他。","content_jianti_auto":"14前司隶校尉傅玄卒。玄性峻急，每有奏劾，或值日暮，捧白简，整簪带，竦踊不寐，坐而待旦；由是贵游震慑，台阁生风。玄与尚书左丞博陵崔洪善，洪亦清厉骨鲠，好面折人过，而退无后言，人以是重之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":6894,"number":14,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第八十 (晉紀二) / 世祖武皇帝上之下 / 四年 / 第 15 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"9ccf48bd-db0e-11ef-aa35-a0d3651f611f","year_int":278},"tongjian_id":"9ccf48bd-db0e-11ef-aa35-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"博陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"back_reference","source_end_index":13,"source_start_index":10,"source_text":"見上卷","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a32f48af-db0e-11ef-8b53-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"定","people_name_jianti_auto":"定","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a36a86d3-db0e-11ef-b8b3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"紹","people_name_jianti_auto":"绍","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a36a86d4-db0e-11ef-9e2d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"謨","people_name_jianti_auto":"谟","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a36a86d5-db0e-11ef-bd25-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"亮","people_name_jianti_auto":"亮","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a36a86d6-db0e-11ef-a2aa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a36a86d7-db0e-11ef-86b1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"定、紹、謨、亮降燕，見上卷上年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"定、绍、谟、亮降燕，见上卷上年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"a36a86d2-db0e-11ef-aaaa-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"秦穆公","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦穆公","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"a36a86da-db0e-11ef-8da1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"茲川","place_name_jianti_auto":"兹川","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a36a86db-db0e-11ef-80ca-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"霸川","place_name_jianti_auto":"霸川","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a36a86dc-db0e-11ef-8bf3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"霸水","place_name_jianti_auto":"霸水","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a36a86dd-db0e-11ef-bba3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滋水","place_name_jianti_auto":"滋水","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a36a86de-db0e-11ef-9596-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滋水","place_name_jianti_auto":"滋水","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"a36a86df-db0e-11ef-b4f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"霸水","place_name_jianti_auto":"霸水","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"a36a86e0-db0e-11ef-b3c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"茲川","place_name_jianti_auto":"兹川","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a36a86e1-db0e-11ef-8dad-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"茲川，卽霸川也；霸水，古曰滋水。秦穆公之霸也，更滋水曰霸水以顯霸功。今曰茲川，因古名也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"兹川，即霸川也；霸水，古曰滋水。秦穆公之霸也，更滋水曰霸水以显霸功。今曰兹川，因古名也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"a36a86d9-db0e-11ef-b5fe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","resolved_place_entity_id":814,"start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"a36c5b7e-db0e-11ef-bee9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"十九年，与秦主登之子崇攻乞伏乾归，败死，陇西之地，皆入于...","context_before":"...，既而其族互相争杀，国乱，咸安初，苻秦遣兵攻之，仇池亡。","source_end_index":436,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d6fb40b7-3cec-5741-bcbe-0ef7d7e2fadc","source_start_index":318,"source_text":"太元十一年，秦苻丕以杨定为雍州牧[定，亦陇右氐，仕苻坚为卫将军，与慕容冲战，为所获，亡奔陇右，收集旧众，丕因而命之]。定自上邽徙治历城[今成县西建安故城是也]，置储蓄于百顷，仍称仇池公，称藩于晋。又略取天水、略阳地，称秦州刺史、陇西王。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"义熙十三年，刘裕伐姚秦，至潼关。秦主泓军霸上。其将姚赞自...","context_before":"...，慕容冲自华阴进向长安，苻坚遣将姜宇等拒之于霸上，败死。","source_end_index":516,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"780b2cce-c31c-5b74-a478-59871f986822","source_start_index":487,"source_text":"十年，苻秦将窦冲据兹川，有众数万，拒姚苌。兹川，即霸水也。"},{"context_after":"《图经》：滮池，一名圣女泉]。","context_before":"...。滮池水本出镐池西，而北流入镐。《诗》：滮池北流。是也。","source_end_index":103,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d83827a8-6442-5410-9e7f-7d74f26db255","source_start_index":65,"source_text":"晋太元十一年，苻秦将邓景帅众据滮池以击后秦。时窦冲据兹川，与景相首尾，是也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、巩昌府（卷五十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"十九年，定为乞伏乾归所败死。盛复称秦州刺史仇池公，分氐羌...","context_before":"...攻之，纂败降秦。置南秦州，改命统为刺史，以其先降于秦也。","source_end_index":597,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"240a5942-4370-5a49-b917-eebc5e1be905","source_start_index":505,"source_text":"太元十年，杨定复据仇池，称仇池公，称藩于晋，寻取天水、略阳地自称陇西王。苻丕以定为雍州牧，定寻徙历城，置储蓄于百顷，定故陇右氐也。既而定兼有上邽，自称秦州牧陇西王，使其叔之子盛守仇池。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/八、巩昌府（卷五十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"41苻定、苻紹、苻謨、苻亮聞秦主丕卽位，皆自河北遣使謝罪；中山太守王兗，本新平氐也，固守博陵，爲秦拒燕。十一月，丕以兗爲平州刺史，定爲冀州牧，紹爲冀州都督，謨爲幽州牧，亮爲幽、平二州都督，並進爵郡公。左將軍竇衝據茲川，有衆數萬，與秦州刺史王統、河州刺史毛興、益州刺史王廣、南秦州刺史楊璧、衞將軍楊定皆自隴右遣使邀丕，共擊後秦。丕以定爲雍州牧，衝爲梁州牧，加統鎭西大將軍，興車騎大將軍，璧征南大將軍，並開府儀同三司，加廣安西將軍，皆進位州牧。","content_fanyi":"苻定、苻绍、苻谟、苻亮听说前秦国主苻丕即位，都从河北派遣使臣前来谢罪；中山太守王兖，本是新平氐人，坚守博陵，为前秦抵抗后燕。十一月，苻丕任命王兖为平州刺史，苻定为冀州牧，苻绍为冀州都督，苻谟为幽州牧，苻亮为幽、平二州都督，并把他们全部晋升爵位为郡公。左将军窦冲占据兹川，拥有部众数万人，与秦州刺史王统、河州刺史毛兴、益州刺史王广、南秦州刺史杨璧、卫将军杨定一起从陇右派使者邀请苻丕，共同攻打后秦。苻丕任命杨定为雍州牧，窦冲为梁州牧，加授王统为镇西大将军，毛兴为车骑大将军，杨璧为征南大将军，并授予开府仪同三司，加授王广为安西将军，全部晋升为州牧。","content_jianti_auto":"41苻定、苻绍、苻谟、苻亮闻秦主丕即位，皆自河北遣使谢罪；中山太守王兖，本新平氐也，固守博陵，为秦拒燕。十一月，丕以兖为平州刺史，定为冀州牧，绍为冀州都督，谟为幽州牧，亮为幽、平二州都督，并进爵郡公。左将军窦冲据兹川，有众数万，与秦州刺史王统、河州刺史毛兴、益州刺史王广、南秦州刺史杨璧、衞将军杨定皆自陇右遣使邀丕，共击后秦。丕以定为雍州牧，冲为梁州牧，加统镇西大将军，兴车骑大将军，璧征南大将军，并开府仪同三司，加广安西将军，皆进位州牧。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9377,"number":41,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百六 (晉紀二十八) / 烈宗孝武皇帝中之上 / 太元十年 / 第 62 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"a36a86d1-db0e-11ef-81ff-a0d3651f611f","year_int":385},"tongjian_id":"a36a86d1-db0e-11ef-81ff-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"博陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韋彪","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦彪","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a36cbdb1-db0e-11ef-ba88-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a36cbdb2-db0e-11ef-a7ed-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"後漢韋彪之言。","note_content_jianti_auto":"后汉韦彪之言。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"a36cbdb0-db0e-11ef-8b24-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"敞","people_name_jianti_auto":"敞","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a36cbdb5-db0e-11ef-9c02-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"王永","people_name_jianti_auto":"王永","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a36cbdb6-db0e-11ef-8876-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"壺關","place_name_jianti_auto":"壶关","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a36cbdb7-db0e-11ef-9db8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"敞時從王永在壺關。","note_content_jianti_auto":"敞时从王永在壶关。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":191,"tongjian_id":"a36cbdb4-db0e-11ef-873a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","resolved_place_entity_id":814,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"a36cbdbd-db0e-11ef-97cf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","resolved_place_entity_id":814,"start_index":146,"tongjian_id":"a36cbdc5-db0e-11ef-b579-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"44慕容麟攻王兗于博陵，城中糧竭矢盡，功曹張猗踰城出，聚衆以應麟。兗臨城數之曰：「卿是秦民，吾是卿君，卿起兵應賊，自號『義兵』，何名實之相違也？古人求忠臣必於孝子之門，卿母在城，棄而不顧，吾何有焉！今人取卿一切之功則可矣；寧能忘卿不忠不孝之事乎？不意中州禮義之邦，乃有如卿者也！」十二月，麟拔博陵，執兗及苻鑑，殺之。昌黎太守宋敞帥烏桓、索頭之衆救兗，不及而還。秦主丕以敞爲平州刺史。","content_fanyi":"后燕将领慕容麟在博陵攻打王兖，城中粮尽箭绝，功曹张猗翻越城墙出城，聚集部众响应慕容麟。王兖登上城墙数落他说：“你是秦国的臣民，我是你的君主，你起兵响应贼寇，自称‘义兵’，为什么名实如此相违呢？古人寻求忠臣一定要到孝子之门，你的母亲就在城里，你却抛弃她不管不顾，对我又有什么损失呢！如今人们要记取你一时的功劳还可以；难道还能忘记你不忠不孝的事情吗？想不到中州这样的礼义之邦，竟然也有像你这样的人！”十二月，后燕将领慕容麟攻下博陵，抓获王兖和苻鉴，将他们杀死。昌黎太守宋敞率领乌桓、索头的部众救援王兖，未能赶到，只好返回。前秦国主苻丕任命宋敞为平州刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"44慕容麟攻王兖于博陵，城中粮竭矢尽，功曹张猗逾城出，聚众以应麟。兖临城数之曰：「卿是秦民，吾是卿君，卿起兵应贼，自号『义兵』，何名实之相违也？古人求忠臣必于孝子之门，卿母在城，弃而不顾，吾何有焉！今人取卿一切之功则可矣；宁能忘卿不忠不孝之事乎？不意中州礼义之邦，乃有如卿者也！」十二月，麟拔博陵，执兖及苻鉴，杀之。昌黎太守宋敞帅乌桓、索头之众救兖，不及而还。秦主丕以敞为平州刺史。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9382,"number":44,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百六 (晉紀二十八) / 烈宗孝武皇帝中之上 / 太元十年 / 第 67 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"a36cbdae-db0e-11ef-b01d-a0d3651f611f","year_int":385},"tongjian_id":"a36cbdae-db0e-11ef-b01d-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"博陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"平規","people_name_jianti_auto":"平规","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a4964b8c-db0e-11ef-a00d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"海陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"海阳县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a4964b8d-db0e-11ef-8f34-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a4964b8e-db0e-11ef-88d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"遼西郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"辽西郡","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a4964b8f-db0e-11ef-8706-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"a4964b90-db0e-11ef-8684-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"海陽縣自漢以來屬遼西郡。平規兄弟以燕兵敗，故叛之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"海阳县自汉以来属辽西郡。平规兄弟以燕兵败，故叛之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"a4964b8b-db0e-11ef-b22a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"白狼","place_name_jianti_auto":"白狼","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a4964b93-db0e-11ef-8ff5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"徐無","place_name_jianti_auto":"徐无","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a4964b94-db0e-11ef-8441-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"白狼、徐無等山之南。","note_content_jianti_auto":"白狼、徐无等山之南。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"a4964b92-db0e-11ef-988c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","resolved_place_entity_id":814,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"a4964b9b-db0e-11ef-916d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、真定府（卷十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"隆安初，拓跋珪攻后燕，围中山，引而南，军于鲁口。义熙十一...","context_before":"...翟辽据鲁口，后燕将慕容农击走之。十六年，后燕主垂如鲁口。","source_end_index":152,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4be6d444-c0e9-5906-bf30-bb42a6e9a8c6","source_start_index":130,"source_text":"二十一年，后燕将平规反于鲁口，垂自将击走之。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/四、真定府（卷十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3燕主垂遣征東將軍平規發兵冀州。二月，規以博陵、武邑、長樂三郡兵反於魯口，其從子冀州刺史喜諫，不聽。規弟海陽令翰亦起兵於遼西以應之。垂遣鎭東將軍餘嵩擊規，嵩敗死。垂自將擊規，至魯口，規棄衆，將妻子及平喜等數十人走渡河，垂引兵還。翰引兵趣龍城，清河公會遣東陽公根等擊翰，破之，翰走山南。","content_fanyi":"后燕主慕容垂派遣征东将军平规统兵开赴冀州。二月，平规带领博陵、武邑、长乐三郡的军队在鲁口反叛后燕，他的侄儿冀州刺史平喜劝阻，平规不听从。平规的弟弟海阳令平翰也在辽西起兵响应平规。慕容垂派遣镇东将军余嵩进攻平规，余嵩战败而死。慕容垂亲自领兵讨伐平规，刚到鲁口，平规便抛弃部众，携带妻子儿女和平喜等数十人渡过黄河逃走，慕容垂于是率军返回。平翰带兵进逼龙城，后燕清河公慕容会派遣东阳公慕容根等人进击平翰，将其击败，平翰逃到山南。","content_jianti_auto":"3燕主垂遣征东将军平规发兵冀州。二月，规以博陵、武邑、长乐三郡兵反于鲁口，其从子冀州刺史喜谏，不听。规弟海阳令翰亦起兵于辽西以应之。垂遣镇东将军余嵩击规，嵩败死。垂自将击规，至鲁口，规弃众，将妻子及平喜等数十人走渡河，垂引兵还。翰引兵趣龙城，清河公会遣东阳公根等击翰，破之，翰走山南。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9664,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八 (晉紀三十) / 烈宗孝武皇帝下 / 二十一年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a4964b89-db0e-11ef-8f54-a0d3651f611f","year_int":396},"tongjian_id":"a4964b89-db0e-11ef-8f54-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"博陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"海渚，海中州也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"海渚，海中州也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"a4a2bb60-db0e-11ef-bda6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"forward_setup","source_end_index":11,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"爲崔宏父子貴顯於魏張本","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a6a2b795-db0e-11ef-b8ae-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"崔宏","people_name_jianti_auto":"崔宏","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"a4a2bb62-db0e-11ef-a2c9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a4a2bb63-db0e-11ef-a5c1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爲崔宏父子貴顯於魏張本。","note_content_jianti_auto":"为崔宏父子贵显于魏张本。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"a4a2bb61-db0e-11ef-83d9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"a4a2bb5f-db0e-11ef-813a-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"gào","source_anchor_text":"令兼總文誥燕范陽王","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":89,"text":"誥","tongjian_id":"cb6adc72-fb3e-59a8-8032-b56f179d61aa"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","resolved_place_entity_id":814,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a4a2bb69-db0e-11ef-8dd7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","resolved_place_entity_id":814,"start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"a4a2bb70-db0e-11ef-9361-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"珪軍于魯口，博陵太守申永奔河南，高陽太守崔宏奔海渚。珪素聞宏名，遣騎追求，獲之，以爲黃門侍郞，與給事黃門侍郞張袞對掌機要，創立制度。博陵令屈遵降魏，珪以爲中書令，出納號令，兼總文誥。","content_fanyi":"拓跋珪率军驻扎在鲁口，后燕博陵太守申永逃奔河南，高阳太守崔宏逃往海岛。拓跋珪一向听说崔宏的名声，就派骑兵追赶搜寻，将他抓获，任命他为黄门侍郎，与给事黄门侍郎张衮共同掌管机要事务，创立各项制度。博陵令屈遵投降北魏，拓跋珪任命他为中书令，掌管号令的发布与接收，并总管文书诏令。","content_jianti_auto":"珪军于鲁口，博陵太守申永奔河南，高阳太守崔宏奔海渚。珪素闻宏名，遣骑追求，获之，以为黄门侍郞，与给事黄门侍郞张衮对掌机要，创立制度。博陵令屈遵降魏，珪以为中书令，出纳号令，兼总文诰。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9698,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八 (晉紀三十) / 烈宗孝武皇帝下 / 二十一年 / 第 37 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a4a2bb5f-db0e-11ef-813a-a0d3651f611f","year_int":396},"tongjian_id":"a4a2bb5f-db0e-11ef-813a-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"博陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"博陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"博陵","resolved_place_entity_id":814,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a4b31b58-db0e-11ef-a21e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"燕主寶使左衞將軍慕輿騰攻博陵，殺魏所置守宰。","content_fanyi":"后燕主慕容宝派左卫将军慕舆腾进攻博陵，杀死北魏所设置的守宰。","content_jianti_auto":"燕主宝使左衞将军慕舆腾攻博陵，杀魏所置守宰。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9709,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百九 (晉紀三十一) / 安皇帝甲 / 隆安元年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a4b31b54-db0e-11ef-a098-a0d3651f611f","year_int":397},"tongjian_id":"a4b31b54-db0e-11ef-a098-a0